# One lap of the netcode session (docs/design/netcode.md, goal 2), run
# over and over by tools/netcode/session.sh on a poor line: the feel yard
# (tools/feel/make_pack.py: stairs to a 4 m deck, a 2 m ledge and a 2 m
# drop, a corridor 2 m wide and half roofed), open ground, and a doorway in
# the town. Places are metres from the hearth; the yard's middle is at
# 140, 150. A snap (a correction shown as a jump) fails the lap.

# --- the yard: a teleport (counted apart: not a correction) -------------
say /feel
wait 3
expect snaps 0
# up the stairs, across the deck, off it onto the ledge and off that
walk-to place 145 144 0.8
walk-to place 154 144 0.8
walk-to place 154 157 0.8
# along the field to the corridor, through it under the roof, and back
walk-to place 137 157 0.8
walk-to place 137 143 0.6
walk-to place 118.5 143 0.6
walk-to place 137 143 0.6
expect snaps 0

# --- open ground: jumping as you run, sneaking, sprinting, strafing --------
walk-to place 140 160 1
hold Space
walk-to place 128 172 1
let-go Space
hold Shift
walk-to place 122 168 1
let-go Shift
hold Ctrl
walk-to place 150 172 1
let-go Ctrl
hold E
wait 1
let-go E
hold Q
wait 1
let-go Q
hold W
wait 0.6
key Space
wait 0.7
key Space
wait 0.4
let-go W
wait 0.3
hold S
wait 0.8
let-go S
expect snaps 0

# --- the town: a doorway, in and out -----------------------------------------
say /spawn
wait 3
walk-through door
expect snaps 0
